ease randomly output one of \"[[A]]\", \"[[B]]\", \"[[C]]\", or \"[[D]]\";\n(3) Please only output the most likely answer index based on the given information, and do not output any other content.\n\n[Story]\nLily and Mark are a young couple, and they have just moved into a new house they bought with a loan. Mark is excited about the new home and says, \"This will be the start of our new life!\" However, when Lily sees Mark sitting quietly alone in the room, he says to her, \"I've actually been worrying if we made the right decision all along.\"\n\n[Question]\nWhy does Mark express both excitement and worry?\n\n[Candidate Answers]\nA. Mark is excited about new home life, but worries about emotional stability.\nB. Mark is excited about the start of new life, but worries about family finances.\nC. Mark is excited about moving into a new home, but worries about job prospects.\nD. Mark is excited about life changes, but worries about social issues.","options":null,"imageContent":null,"audioContent":null,"videoContent":null,"reminderContext":null,"videoCoverUrl":null,"chips":null,"customMessage":null,"media":null,"mediaTime":null,"interceptContent":null,"contents":[],"imgs":null,"regenerations":0,"seqNum":2,"responseSource":"agent:llm","isSuicide":false,"isSuicideConf":0.0031726830309918535,"emotions":[],"relationId":"6af3e3b1d6006945d2805d75","courseProgressId":0,"tsGen":1794368433025,"createTime":"2026-11-11 11:40:33","delFlag":0,"emotionTendency":null,"sourceProductType":null,"sourceProductId":null,"consultantBotId":null,"consultantUserId":null}],"first":true,"last":true},"nonce":"d3657abac27c439baf687bb8e1cc6b6a"}